Error [jet.DeferLeavesItsBlock]: `return` can't leave a `defer` body
  --> tests/ui/defer_return.jet:4:9
    |
  4 |         return
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: A `defer` body runs as its block ends, after the block's own exit was chosen, so it can't choose another.
 Fix: Take the `return` out of the `defer` body and choose the exit in the block itself.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0509
